  "note": "Shared activity-run vectors. Each case is a sequence of visible top-level rows in timeline order. `runs` is the maximal-run classification of docs/architecture/timeline-window-pages.md §1: a row is a member when it is a rail row (kind tool_call, tool_completion, terminal_interaction or thinking, payload kind not proposed_plan) or a notification with a member immediately before it. Each run's `stubs` state §4's aggregate for one shipped span: `shippedIds` are the members a page shipped, in order, and the remaining fields are what the server's ActivityRunStub and the client's own classification of the same rows must both produce. `unshippedGroups` is sorted by (kind, toolName, mcp) and `unshippedPairedLaunchIds` by id. Shared by internal/store/activity_runs.go and frontend/src/lib/utils/activityRunGrouping.ts with components/chat/activityRunSummary.ts; the two copies of this file must stay byte-identical.",
